  "title": "Supplementary Table S8. Logistic regression models for accelerated BAA",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. Accelerated biological ageing was defined as BAA in the upper two quintiles versus the lower two quintiles. EVI was scaled per 0.1-unit increase and O₃ per 10 μg m⁻³ increase. Single- and dual-exposure models were estimated by unweighted logistic regression with robust standard errors (no participant-level random effects; N = 4,751 observations).",
    "Abbreviations: BAA, biological age acceleration; CI, confidence interval; EVI, enhanced vegetation index; O₃, ozone; OR, odds ratio."
